    "body": "It seems reasonable and is something folks have been asking for. I'm not sure about implementation complexity, but the removed code doesn't look too large -- so it shouldn't be too bad.\r\n\r\nI can only think of one minor issue at this time: It may interact in ways surprising to developers if an error occurs during loading. I.e., it could look like a resource wasn't selected due to the query but instead due to a load error that causes the next source child to be loaded.",
